# Build-context whitelist for the self-host Docker image.
# Story 4.4 / FR-11 — keeps the build context small + reproducible
# by excluding anything the web build does not need.

# Generated / cached artefacts
**/.dart_tool/
**/build/
**/.pub-cache/
**/.pub/
**/ephemeral/

# Editor / OS noise
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.DS_Store
**/*.iml

# VCS metadata (git metadata is not needed in the image)
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# CI / docs / governance that the runtime does not need
**/.github/
**/docs/
**/_bmad-output/
**/_bmad/

# Secrets and local tooling must never enter the build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.claude/

# Test surface (the production image is `flutter build web --release`).
# NB: generated `*.g.dart` files (drift's app_database.g.dart) are committed
# and REQUIRED by the build — never exclude them.
**/test/
**/integration_test/

# Self-host smoke test (Story 4.4)
scripts/smoke_self_host.sh

# Signing material / machine-local config (Android).
**/key.properties
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/local.properties
